      "description": "配套 Roslyn 分析器（DiagnosticAnalyzer），在编辑器中实时提供代码修复建议，包括为类型添加 [Equatable] 特性、标记为 partial、为属性添加相等性特性等",
      "evidence": ["Generator.Equals/Analyzers/EquatableAnalyzer.cs", "Generator.Equals/Analyzers/DiagnosticDescriptors.cs", "Generator.Equals/Analyzers/CodeFixes/AddEquatableAttributeCodeFix.cs", "Generator.Equals/Analyzers/CodeFixes/MakeTypePartialCodeFix.cs"]
    }
  ],
